//    with the character the layout in use prints, where the engine can say
//    what that is (`navigator.keyboard.getLayoutMap()`). Where it cannot, a
//    captured key's own character is taken, when neither Alt nor Shift was held
//    to change it. Every other key keeps the label of its place on a US board,
//    the label `nc_schema::keys` gives it.
